      "en": ": Yeah, sure. Probably not when you’re driving a car, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, probably not. But don’t worry, I’ll protect you. Defensive driving — commence.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Where are we going anyway? We missed the turn to get to your place like five minutes ago.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere special.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Another one of those sketchy hotels?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We can stop at one if you can’t hold it in any longer. I had somewhere else in mind, though.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere else, like...where?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ll see when we get there.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene21.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is...everything okay?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene22.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You just...seem kind of tired.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene23",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene23.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene23"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve just been without you for so long that-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Eyes on the road.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene24",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene24.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene24"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve just been without you for so long that the battery which powers my heart is dangerously low on energy.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He hit you again, didn’t he?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene20.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What did I tell you about asking questions you don’t want the answer to?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll kill him...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll be fine. You worry about yourself, okay?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But I don’t care about myself. I care about-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Akira, stop.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene25",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene25.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene25"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m fine.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But thank you.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The fact you’re worried...means everything to me.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She keeps her eyes on the road from that point on...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene26",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene26.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But she doesn’t have to for long since we arrive at our destination not long after.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The train station?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Give me your hand.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are we at the-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hand. Now.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene27",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene27.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene27"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I do as she asks and entangle my fingers with hers. They’re about the same size now — but it feels like only yesterday that hers made me feel so small.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Same excuse as always if anyone asks?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No one ever asks. No one ever will ask either. We probably just look like soulmates.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Either that or they just assume you’re my age.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s probably the other way around now, Aki-kun. You’ve grown so much. You’re practically a man now.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are we here, Sekai?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene28",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene28.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene28"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve seemed off since you picked me up. And I can tell, you know. I’ve been watching you for years.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I know you can tell, Aki-kun.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I want you to be able to tell.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But today, I’d like it a little more if you can just follow me to the edge of the universe.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You heard me.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, but you’re being all cryptic again and I never know what you’re trying to say when you do that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t you tired of this place, Aki-kun?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t you ever want to just...go somewhere else?",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Somewhere far...far away from here?...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re not...jumping in front of this train, are we?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene29",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene29.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene29"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course not...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene30",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene30.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene30"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We’re just running away together.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": To Kyoto.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kyoto?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have friends there. One of them will give us a place to stay. I’m sure of it.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have friends everywhere, Sekai. I have no idea how you do it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ll come, right?...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Won’t you, Aki-kun?...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sekai...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene31",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene31.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene31"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please tell me you’ll come...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please...I need you.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s going on with you?...Seriously...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene32",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene32.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene32"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t ask questions you-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you want me to even consider coming, you need to talk to me. Otherwise I’m going to think this is just another one of your episodes.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m scared, Akira.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I keep...hearing things. Things that...confuse the fuck out of me. And they’re getting angrier and scarier and driving me up a wall and the only time I get any amount of silence anymore is when I’m with you.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Which is why we need to get away. And in a couple years, we can make this official and...buy a house. With a garden. Be free.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But here, I...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Here that’s...not possible.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Sure it is...You can dump him any time you want. But we can’t just leave. Niki’s here and-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Akira, I’m pregnant.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re...what?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t make me say it again. It was hard enough the first time.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The...train is going to be here soon.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Sekai springs out of her seat so quickly that I worry she’s about to dive right onto the tracks. But I’m too dumbfounded to try and make use of our interlocked fingers to pull her back to both reality and me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene33",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene33.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene33"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean you’re pregnant?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aki-kun, the train-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fuck the train! What do you mean?!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll tell you more in Kyoto, okay?! You’re coming, right?!",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not if you’re carrying that fucking asshole’s child, I’m not!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene34",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene34.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene34"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have a...I have a life here! And Niki...I can’t just leave her! You think we can just run away and make this work?! How?! Are you out of your mind?!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Akira, don’t yell. People are going to-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t care! I don’t care if anyone’s suspicious! I don’t care if anyone thinks I’m being dramatic! I don’t care if anyone knows I love you!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene35",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene35.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene35"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I love you too, Akira! Which is exactly why I’m going to-",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t care what your plan is! For years I have watched you do the wrong thing and admired you anyway! But there’s someone else who loves me now too! It’s not just you anymore!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And even if...even if I do love you...I can’t just leave her behind and run away with you on a whim! That’s not how adults are meant to deal with their problems, is it?! Is it?!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene36",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene36.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene36"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aki-kun...that’s enough.",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Enough?!",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene replayscene37",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/replayscene37.webp",
      "alt": "replayscene37"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Enough!",
      "spk": "Sekai",
      "spkColor": "#FF0055",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
